{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If <strong>StarVaders</strong> has been fun for you and you'd like to help us develop even more games, the Supporter Pack is a wonderful way to show your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We (Pengonauts) are a small and new 3-person studio based in Montreal, Canada. StarVaders is our first game, but we have many great plans ahead for both StarVaders and other games beyond!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re grateful for any help, but remember \u2013 buying the pack is entirely up to you, and your enjoyment of the game is what matters the most!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This bundle is purely cosmetic and won\u2019t affect the gameplay experience. To change skins, go into OPTIONS, under the EXTRAS tab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Supporter Pack includes the following:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 new skin for Roxy: <strong>Fighter Ace Roxy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 new skin for Shun: <strong>Biopunk Shun</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 new skin for Iris: <strong>Lil Witch Iris</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3632550?t=1745437288","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3632550?t=1745437288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632550/21e98ba602655a439f0a1cea1efc79f62a17b213/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745437288","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632550/21e98ba602655a439f0a1cea1efc79f62a17b213/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745437288","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If <strong>StarVaders</strong> has been fun for you and you'd like to help us develop even more games, the Supporter Pack is a wonderful way to show your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We (Pengonauts) are a small and new 3-person studio based in Montreal, Canada. StarVaders is our first game, but we have many great plans ahead for both StarVaders and other games beyond!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re grateful for any help, but remember \u2013 buying the pack is entirely up to you, and your enjoyment of the game is what matters the most!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This bundle is purely cosmetic and won\u2019t affect the gameplay experience. To change skins, go into OPTIONS, under the EXTRAS tab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Supporter Pack includes the following:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 new skin for Roxy: <strong>Fighter Ace Roxy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 new skin for Shun: <strong>Biopunk Shun</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 new skin for Iris: <strong>Lil Witch Iris</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Pengonauts"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2097570","name":"StarVaders"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632550/890c1e320e93868bda1ccee3fce000c7290b871a/header.jpg?t=1745437288","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"StarVaders - Supporter Pack","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Joystick Ventures"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors